pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> </span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Performance</span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:normal;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> </span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Table</span></h2><p style="text-indent:5.067%;font-size:10pt;margin-top:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:justify;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">As required by SEC rules, the following table provides information on the total compensation, as reported in the Summary  Compensation Table ("SCT") and compensation actually paid ("CAP") to our principal executive officer (&#8220;PEO&#8221;) and to our other named executive officers (&#8220;NEOs&#8221;) for the fiscal years ended December 31, 2025, December 31, 2024 and December 31, 2023 and (i) the cumulative shareholder return on our common stock and (ii) our net income over the same time period. This information is presented based on methodology that has been prescribed by the SEC.</span></p><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><span style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:9.5pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</span></p>
